  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major performance update.\n\n      - Deprecated and removed the previous Utf8Dictionary, Utf8ConcurrentDictionary, and IUtf8Store implementations.\n      - Reworked Utf8Map architecture to rely on optimized internal storage without maintaining a separate bucket layer, reducing memory overhead and improving lookup locality.\n      - Added Span-based lookup support to avoid unnecessary ByteString intermediate allocations during key comparisons.\n      - Introduced optimized ByteString comparison paths for ReadOnlySpan<byte> inputs, enabling faster zero-allocation equality checks.\n      - Improved hashing pipeline with a new high-performance hash algorithm optimized for byte-oriented workloads.\n      - Integrated optimized hash and equality execution paths for network-oriented scenarios, reducing lookup overhead on hot paths.\n      - Enhanced SIMD-assisted comparison capabilities through runtime-optimized .NET memory APIs.\n      - Reduced allocations and improved throughput for high-frequency request routing and byte key lookup workloads.\n      - Benchmarks show 2-3x throughput improvements on optimized workloads, exceeding 100K requests/sec on constrained test environments.\n      - Designed for scalable high-throughput scenarios where zero-allocation memory access and efficient byte processing are critical.",
